            "paragraph": "The Integrated Ocean Drilling Program Expedition (IODP) 302 (or the Arctic Coring Expedition) recently recovered a Palaeogene marine sedimentary record from Hole 4A (~87\u00b052.00\u0384 \u039d; 136\u00b0 10.64\u2032 E; 1,288 m water depth), on the Lomonosov ridge in the central Arctic Ocean. ... Expedition 302 Scientists (those not listed above): ... Fr\u00e9d\u00e9rique Eynaud\u00b3, ... \u00b3Department de G\u00e9ologie et Oc\u00e9anographie, Universit\u00e9 Bordeaux 1, Avenue des facult\u00e9s, c/o Bernei Housen, 33405 Talence Cedex, France.",
